[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0010","text":"……终于要开始了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0020","text":"甘奈的……\n不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0030","text":"甘奈她们的第一步\n就要从这里开始了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0040","text":"啊啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0050","text":"制作人\n甘奈，会全力以赴的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0060","text":"要是稍微松懈一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0070","text":"至今为止的努力\n就会白费了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0080","text":"甘奈一定能做到的\n相信你一路走来的努力就没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0090","text":"……嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0100","text":"制作人\n甘奈，出发了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11400100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
